/* ── slice 9: the ZCODE Rankings ───────────────────────────────────────
 * Daily/weekly/monthly/all-time leaderboards ranking EARNED ZCODE SCORE
 * only — never a wallet token balance (no balance or transfer record
 * kind exists anywhere in the reward ledger, so purchased or transferred
 * ZCODE structurally cannot move rankings). The leaderboard is a
 * REBUILDABLE PROJECTION over the slice-8 reward-history ledger, rebuilt
 * on every call; period windows are exact civil-day ranges (UTC days,
 * ISO-8601 weeks, calendar months) computed PURELY — the caller passes
 * "today" via `day` (the host clock only when omitted). The two P2P
 * categories (verified-bytes-served, distinct-package-users) are named
 * unavailable and report zero honestly until slices 11-12. */

ZCL_COMMAND_BRANCH("zcode.leaderboard", "zcode",
                   "ZCODE Rankings: earned-score leaderboards (never "
