    "rankings, the slice-3 publish history), at `day` (a civil day "
    "number; default: host today). Every row names available/eligible, "
    "the evidence fact in `detail`, and — when eligible — the "
    "achievement period, the evidence root, and already_issued (the "
    "dedup check against the durable badge store under the configured "
    "badge policy). popular-package and rare-package-seeder are named "
    "unavailable (P2P facts arrive with slices 11-12) — honestly, never "
    "faked. policy_present says whether <datadir>/zcode/badge_policy is "
    "configured.",
    ZCL_COMMAND_LIST_BUDGET,
    "zcode,badge,eligible,achievement,contributor,period",
    "zcl.zcode_badge_eligible.input.v1", "zcl.zcode_badge_eligible.v1",
    "pubkey,day,datadir", "pubkey",
    "zclassic23 zcode badge eligible --input='{\"pubkey\":\"<66hex>\",\"day\":20500}'",
    ZCL_COMMAND_LAYER_APP, ZCL_COMMAND_SCOPE_NODE, ZCL_COMMAND_AUTH_OPERATOR,
    ZCL_COMMAND_LATENCY_FAST, ZCL_COMMAND_COST_LOW,
    ZCL_COMMAND_LANE_LOCAL | ZCL_COMMAND_LANE_ALL_NODE,
    ZCL_COMMAND_CAP_NONE, ZCL_COMMAND_TRAIT_IDEMPOTENT,
